  <widget type="label" version="2.0.0">
    <name>Robot_Safety_Note</name>
    <x>45</x>
    <y>700</y>
    <width>920</width>
    <height>70</height>
    <text>Motion commands, motor-enable controls, ZERO and HOME are intentionally not exposed here before physical robot commissioning. The known hardware reference is the home-switch position; software travel limits are not yet trusted.</text>
    <font>
      <font family="Liberation Sans" style="REGULAR" size="12.0" />
    </font>
    <wrap_words>true</wrap_words>
    <transparent>true</transparent>
  </widget>
  <widget type="label" version="2.0.0">
    <name>Robot_Footer</name>
    <x>30</x>
    <y>825</y>
    <width>980</width>
    <height>50</height>
    <text>Physical operation must begin from the verified home reference. Use the hardware enable/stop procedure during commissioning.</text>
    <font>
